# Chickpea Salad

Based on [https://downshiftology.com/recipes/mediterranean-chickpea-salad](https://downshiftology.com/recipes/mediterranean-chickpea-salad/#wprm-recipe-container-43469) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251230135411/https://downshiftology.com/recipes/mediterranean-chickpea-salad/))

{ rating="4" image="chickpea_salad.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 2 cans (15 oz each) [Chickpeas]{ ing="chickpeas" }, rinsed and drained
- [ ] 1 large [Cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" }, large dice
- [ ] 1 [Red Bell Pepper]{ ing="red-bell-pepper" }, large dice
- [ ] 2 cups [Cherry Tomatoes]{ ing="cherry-tomatoes" }, halved
- [ ] 1/4 cup [Red Onion]{ ing="red-onion" }, diced
- [ ] 4 ounces [Feta Cheese]{ ing="feta-cheese" }, crumbled
- [ ] 1/4 cup [Parsley]{ ing="parsley" }, finely chopped
- [ ] (Optional) [Avocado]{ ing="avocado" }, medium diced

### Dressing

- [ ] 3 Tbsp [Olive Oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
- [ ] 2 Tbsp [Lemon Juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }
- [ ] 1 [garlic clove]{ ing="garlic-clove" }, minced
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [Dried Oregano]{ ing="dried-oregano" }
- [ ] [Salt and black pepper]{ ing="salt-and-black-pepper" }, to taste

## Recipe

1. Make the dressing: In a small bowl, whisk together [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }, [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }, garlic, [oregano]{ ing="dried-oregano" }, salt, and [pepper]{ ing="red-bell-pepper" }
1. Prep vegetables: Dice [cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" } and bell pepper, halve [tomatoes]{ ing="cherry-tomatoes" }, dice [onion]{ ing="red-onion" }, chop [parsley]{ ing="parsley" }
1. Combine: In a large bowl, add [chickpeas]{ ing="chickpeas" } and all vegetables. Pour dressing over and toss well
1. Top with crumbled feta and optional [avocado]{ ing="avocado" }. Serve immediately or refrigerate for 30 minutes to let flavors meld

## Notes

1. For meal prep: Store dressing separately and add just before serving to keep vegetables crisp
1. Add protein: Top with grilled chicken or hard-boiled eggs for a complete meal
